{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225960/extras/SteamPage_Line.png?t=1748877856\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOU ARE THE FINAL BOSS.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your Dungeon Boss\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick and Addictive Runs\u00a0(&lt; 30 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forge your own Build:</strong> Equip Boss Patterns, summon Minions, physics-based Chain Spikeballs, kickable Wrecking Balls (play soccer with your Minions or co-op players), guns, grow Plant Minions with your Watering Can or a Cloud Spell, turn enemies into Sheep or Golden Statues (or both?), mine Ore, deploy Turrets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wild Theorycrafting &amp; Emergent Gameplay</strong>:\u00a0Discover unique synergies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Break the Game</strong>: Push your Amount or Size stats to absurd levels and watch the screen explode in chaos! Use the Cheater Item to stack unique items multiple times</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play as a <strong>Giant Worm Boss, Spider Queen, Seductive Succubus</strong> and more</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wave-Based Carnage: Survive increasingly intense raids of Noobs </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Level Up and Shop:\u00a0Collect souls to level up and buy powerful upgrades </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unlock tons of content and challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute and Badass artstyle,\u00a0<strong>Banger OST</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Parody RPG Universe, meta humor and funny cutscenes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Singleplayer and multiplayer</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4 players Local Co-op</strong> (+ Steam Remote Play Together)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Twitch Streamer Mode</strong>: noobs takes usernames and messages from chat</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NOOBS ARE COMING!</strong> <strong>Show them who's the boss</strong></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2225960?t=1748877856","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2225960?t=1748877856","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225960/1a27a599308e0394c53569369b6d745d08b47b4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748877856","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225960/1a27a599308e0394c53569369b6d745d08b47b4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748877856","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3491930,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2225960/extras/SteamPage_Line.png?t=1748877856\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YOU ARE THE FINAL BOSS.</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pick your Dungeon Boss\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quick and Addictive Runs\u00a0(&lt; 30 minutes)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Forge your own Build:</strong> Equip Boss Patterns, summon Minions, physics-based Chain Spikeballs, kickable Wrecking Balls (play soccer with your Minions or co-op players), guns, grow Plant Minions with your Watering Can or a Cloud Spell, tu